# The pi-gen commit every Milō image is built on, declared once: pi-gen/build.sh
# and .github/workflows/build-image.yml both source this file, fetch exactly this
# commit and refuse to build on any other. A branch moves under a build that
# names it, so two images of one Milō tag built a week apart could differ in
# everything stage0-2 lays down, with nothing saying which pi-gen either came
# from.
#
# It sits on pi-gen's `arm64` branch. To move it: read that branch's head
# (`git ls-remote https://github.com/RPi-Distro/pi-gen.git refs/heads/arm64`),
# build an image on it and pass pi-gen/inspect-image.sh, then commit the new
# hash here.
PIGEN_REPO="https://github.com/RPi-Distro/pi-gen.git"
PIGEN_COMMIT="c0d2c9f2cffc08bc56850b0a3eb23178f4226e8a"
